      "title": "TIFF: Add a tiff_ prefix to internal items",
      "message": "TIFF: Add a tiff_ prefix to internal items\n\nAdd a tiff_ prefix (or change dissect_ to dissect_tiff_) to all\nstatic internal items to avoid namespace collisions.\n",
      "author_name": "Daniel Dulaney",
