      ],
      "title": "TIFF: Add a basic TIFF dissector",
      "message": "TIFF: Add a basic TIFF dissector\n\nAdd a new dissector for Adobe's Tagged Image File Format (TIFF). This\ndissector includes labels for all tags in the TIFF 6.0 specification,\nbut will only fully dissect the most common ones. Unknown tags are\nskipped and flagged with expert info.\n\nSupported TIFF features include:\n- Big-endian and little-endian decoding\n- Multi-image TIFF file support\n- Full support for bilevel TIFF files\n- Partial support for other color patterns\n\nAdditionally, the TIFF magic numbers are added to wiretap/mime_file.c,\nallowing TIFF files to be opened directly.\n",
      "author_name": "Daniel Dulaney",
      "author_email": "dulaney.daniel@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-04-07T15:46:19.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
